        "original_id": "8f0fda74-873b-5f8b-833c-05444bcffa3e",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: The Australian Women's Weekly, Godey's Lady's Book, Fresh with the Australian Women's Weekly, Lyndey and Blair's Taste of Greece\n- Companies: Bauer Media Group\n- People: Lyndey Milan, Blair\n- Places: Sydney, Philadelphia, Greece, Athens, Corinth, Peloponnese, Kythira\n- Topics: women's magazines, food and wine television\n\nFacts:\n- Godey's Lady's Book was a United States women's magazine published in Philadelphia from 1830 to 1878.\n- The Australian Women's Weekly is an Australian monthly women's magazine published by Bauer Media Group in Sydney.\n- Lyndey Milan was the Food Director for The Australian Women's Weekly.\n- Lyndey Milan was a co-host of the Channel 9 show Fresh with the Australian Women's Weekly.\n- Lyndey and Blair's Taste of Greece follows food and wine personality Lyndey Milan and her actor and voice-over artist son Blair as they tour Greece, including Athens, Corinth, the Peloponnese, and Kythira.",
